      "worked": "$a=3$, $r=7$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}a_n&=ar^{n-1}\\\\352\\,947&=3(7)^{n-1}\\\\117\\,649&=7^{n-1}\\\\7^6&=7^{n-1}\\\\n-1&=6\\\\n&=7\\end{align*}$$\n\nTherefore, it is the 7th term.",
